  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JISRA programme Tearfund NL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JISRA is a five year programme (BuZa funded) that empowers religious actors and faith communities to promote freedom of religion or belief. In four countries Tearfund is active in building inclusive peaceful societies: Nigeria, Iraq, Ethiopia and Mali. The country level work is complemented by global lobby &amp; advocacy, knowledge and learning and communication, in order to effectively strengthen the FoRB and peacebuilding capacity of faith actors. JISRA is a consortium based programme, consisting of Mensen met een Missie, Search for Common Ground, Faith to Action.</narrative>
  </description>
